(ns dk.simongray.elektrolyt.ui.icons
  "Phosphor's icons in the Light weight, and in the Fill and Thin weights
  under names that end in theirs: a def for the path of each, named as
  Phosphor names it, e.g. play, gear-six or bookmark-simple-fill.

  The icon alias of ui.controls draws a path in the colour of the text
  around it. This namespace holds only the icons that the code uses,
  so that the dev build stays small. To use another, write
  icons/<name> and run write-icons! again. Phosphor's site shows them
  all: https://phosphoricons.com")

